  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Justice System Programme - 2nd Phase</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Following the successful completion of the Justice Sector System Programme and the development of key national reform documents &#x2014; including the Towards Better Justice &#x2013; Analysis and Recommendations for Improving the Justice Sector in Timor-Leste and the Securing Land Rights &#x2013; Analysis and Recommendations for Improving Land Administration in Timor-Leste &#x2014; this second phase aims to support the Government of Timor-Leste, under the leadership of the Office of the Prime Minister and the Ministry of Justice, in operationalizing and implementing the recommendations and reforms identified in these landmark initiatives.</narrative>
  </description>
